ments."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How much does online therapy cost in India?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"At Never Alone, a complete 60-minute single therapy consultation is priced at flat ₹797 with no hidden fees or mandatory long-term packages."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is Never Alone therapy completely private and anonymous?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes, all sessions take place over encrypted private audio connections. No video is required and your personal identity remains 100% confidential."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Which languages are supported by Never Alone therapists?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Therapists and companions on Never Alone are fluent in Hindi, English, Marathi, Tamil, Telugu, and Bengali."}}]},{"@type":"BreadcrumbList","itemListElement":[{"@type":"ListItem","position":1,"name":"Home","item":"https://neveralone.in"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":2,"name":"First Session (₹797)","item":"https://neveralone.in/first-session"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":3,"name":"Companions","item":"https://neveralone.in/companions"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":4,"name":"Professional Support","item":"https://neveralone.in/professional-support"}]}]}5:X
